    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend deep into the crevices of the dungeon...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/2325220d7c4335bab5ee611ca095f8ed.poster.avif?t=1733971035\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/2325220d7c4335bab5ee611ca095f8ed.webm?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/2325220d7c4335bab5ee611ca095f8ed.mp4?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a dark fantasy dungeon-crawling adventure where every choice shapes your fate. Navigate treacherous dungeons filled with dangerous encounters, powerful artifacts, and seductive companions. Build your strength to overcome formidable bosses, trekking deeper to see if you'll go all the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outfit your heroes with Equipment and strategy-defining Artifacts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/973d515140470d53a620ab2fc7b6b5aa.poster.avif?t=1733971035\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/973d515140470d53a620ab2fc7b6b5aa.webm?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/973d515140470d53a620ab2fc7b6b5aa.mp4?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build your playstyle around unique artifacts each run, supplementing your party's strengths with equipment looted from enemies or found as treasure. Take every opportunity to improve your stats and keep an eye out for chances to enhance your loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take command of tactical auto-battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/f2c25f2f7784ce7e7bdbfe065f7c2b94.poster.avif?t=1733971035\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/f2c25f2f7784ce7e7bdbfe065f7c2b94.webm?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/f2c25f2f7784ce7e7bdbfe065f7c2b94.mp4?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control over the battle with dark and divine incantations. Manage your health and mana to survive through every encounter that comes your way. Allies use their own abilities once they've charged up to turn the tides of the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know every side of your allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/75a48ce2c3b95dd57b0c96ab2c9aac6f.poster.avif?t=1733971035\" width=616 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/75a48ce2c3b95dd57b0c96ab2c9aac6f.webm?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173540/extras/75a48ce2c3b95dd57b0c96ab2c9aac6f.mp4?t=1733971035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only adventurer seeking riches within the dungeon; Three alluring allies can be recruited to your cause, each with their own skill set and carnal progression. Unique opportunities may present themselves once you're strong enough to overcome the dungeons challenges. A truly talented hero may even find themselves being the one pursued and wooed.</p>",
